{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Brave New World of the Internet", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Look Into the Future", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "  Accurately use information about common technology in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Questions Within Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span><br/>Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\"> embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">  Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">  Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification.<br/> Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Can you tell us where the future of technology is headed? (question with sentence)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you think that we should feel threatened by how smart our devices are? (asking for clarification)", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking About the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal verb <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li>  <li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Verb Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Future Tense (Will)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Diseases such as cancer or diabetes will be a thing of the past. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Computers are going to surpass the thinking capacity of the human mind in the next five years.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm starting a computer project with a team of doctors next month.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Present Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> We expect good results by the end of the year.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "artificial intelligence", "type": "name"}, {"content": "computer systems able to perform tasks that normally require human intelligence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: With artificial intelligence,  computers are able to complete what we normally do at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk about the future of technology.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exponentially", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at a rate that increases quickly by large amounts", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Artificial intelligence has improved exponentially in recent years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "decade", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of ten years", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Artificial intelligence has improved exponentially in the past decade.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to surpass", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be better or greater than someone or something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Artificial intelligence is going to surpass the thinking capacity of the human mind in the next five years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "per se", "type": "name"}, {"content": "as such", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I don't believe that the danger lies in the machines per se.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "processing power", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the ability of a computer to perform operations", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We can use the processing power that we possess to cure diseases.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "a thing of the past", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that is not relevant anymore; outdated", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Diseases such as cancer or diabetes will be a thing of the past. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to defeat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to beat; to vanquish", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I strongly believe that we will defeat cancer by 2050.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you are a journalist writing about new technologies. Write a newspaper column of 10 - 14 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give your opinion on new technologies, using your experience and thoughts about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imagine what the future of technology will be like in the next 5 years and then in 20 years.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use Future tenses (<span class=\"italic\">will</span> and <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your column aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about new technologies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about future actions and ideas.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify new ways to discuss technology with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le10ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Mr. Anderson, can you tell us where the future of technology is headed? In your opinion, what is the biggest technological challenge that we are going to face in the next five years?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    I believe that we have reached a point where computers and other electronic devices are able to complete the many daily tasks that we do at work. Artificial intelligence has improved exponentially in the past decade. I think it is going to surpass the thinking capacity of the human mind in the next five years."}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Does this thought scare you? Do you think that we should feel threatened by how smart our devices are?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    That's a good question. I don't believe that the danger lies in the machines per se, but in the use that we are going to make of them from now on. With the processing power that we possess, diseases such as cancer or diabetes will be a thing of the past."}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "52500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Don't you think this sounds too optimistic?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    Not at all. I'm starting a computer project with a team of doctors next month. Their research looks promising. We expect good results by the end of the year.  I strongly believe that we will defeat cancer by 2050.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Let's hope so!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le10ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le10ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask for clarification or use rhetorical questions to emphasize a point. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you feel that we spend too much time on our electronic devices? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think that technology will help solve problems like diseases? Which problems?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "typ